    "created_at": "2015-08-15T08:03:27Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-08-15T08:03:27Z",
    "body": "Issue seems to be solved. Tracker list order is preserved.\n\nUsers should keep in mind that \"Present trackers in all torrent files\" box still lists the trackers alphabetically (it's not a bug):\n\n<img width=\"328\" alt=\"order\" src=\"https://cloud.githubusercontent.com/assets/12573989/9288059/d8947ec6-433c-11e5-97eb-ed594810717d.png\">\n\nHowever, preferred trackers order is preserved as shown in torrent client:\n\n<img width=\"243\" alt=\"order 2\" src=\"https://cloud.githubusercontent.com/assets/12573989/9288065/0dedf0e8-433d-11e5-8001-4ba5e4ce2178.png\">\n\nThank you.\n",
